{
 "case:accusation.methods.0": "Used the archive passage and the master key to enter Studio B, then struck Marcus with the brass reel weight.",
 "case:accusation.methods.1": "Lured Marcus to the quay, staged the door, and used the broadcast system to fake the time of death.",
 "case:accusation.methods.2": "Disabled the building cameras, entered through reception, and poisoned Marcus before leaving.",
 "case:accusation.methods.3": "Confronted Marcus in Studio A, pushed him into the desk, and hid the contract in the archive.",
 "case:accusation.motives.0": "To stop Marcus exposing a private rights agreement before the Vesper sale.",
 "case:accusation.motives.1": "To punish Tom for humiliating her during the live programme.",
 "case:accusation.motives.2": "To save Rookery Audio from being sold to Vesper Media.",
 "case:accusation.motives.3": "To inherit Marcus’s shares through Clare’s family trust.",
 "case:accusation.proofLabels.0": "The false live alibi",
